Only a few tables recur across the two editions, and I linked only those that clearly match in subject and breakdown.

- **Domestic wheat production and acreage** matches between japan-1937 p0616_1 and japan-1942-43 p0586_1. Both give production and acreage by year.
- **Sugar and beer tables** have no counterpart in the 1942-43 listing.
- **Production of soap by kind** and the **Production of Superphosphates** table have no 1937 counterpart.
- **Canned provisions** have no counterpart either.

No other cross-edition pairs are clear enough to link.

